{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4c8518fbdbc6dc73f839ac8deb132890a44787f2c93d0e0aa9975402b3175b5a", "ja": "（関西での収録から帰って数日。相変わらずツアー\n関係で忙しく、今日もランチの時間を逃してしまった）", "zh": "（从关西录音回来已经过了几天。和往常一样，还是因为巡演相关的工作忙得不可开交，今天也错过了午饭时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "be76ab7f9a2df6dbbeda4f9222ff2af9f5284437ed70d8f8388f25e31548147d", "ja": "{$P$}！\nお疲れさま！　今、時間大丈夫？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n辛苦啦！现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8ac17efb83ad89f54a2d307c63a742ee4ff001e1b5635f85c62ff22e14106d06", "ja": "お、響、お疲れさま。大丈夫だけど、どうした？", "zh": "哦，响，辛苦了。没事，不过怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "a5c14517cb19659ff4c623d8a098749d37d4a8f8cf8cb779fa998eef31599a19", "ja": "あのね、この間の番組で自分たちが考えたタコライス、\nお店の新メニューになったって言ったでしょ？", "zh": "那个啊，上次节目里我们想出来的塔可饭，\n我说过已经成了店里的新菜品对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "4b7375764f177a707b29259196f47fa69a42af62474152fef464050386c12c10", "ja": "そのタコライス弁当、めちゃくちゃ評判いいみたいで、\n毎日売り切れてるんだって！", "zh": "那个塔可饭便当好像特别受欢迎，据说每天都卖光了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "909210eb3fb8fa7c540017c589c8ccafdc914543c6feea6c095fc68a1464ff53", "ja": "さっき社長ちゃんから連絡が来たんだ。\nお店のSNSにも、たくさんコメントがついてたぞ！", "zh": "刚才社长联系我了。\n店铺的社交账号上也收到了好多评论哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3cf398283bd730222d123dee9120dab97f387a22ea0de3085cbf11ca64c094fc", "ja": "おお、それはよかったな！\n確かにあのタコライス、おいしかったからなぁ……。", "zh": "哦，那太好了！\n确实，那份塔可饭很好吃啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "073d3301109b0e4aef547ed02e9ebd4137f4cc7b12167834f0cb378bc40b2044", "ja": "それでね……えへへ♪\n{$P$}、これを受け取って！", "zh": "然后啊……嘿嘿♪\n{$P$}，请收下这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "fab307820614c45523eef4f006cbcdd1a4ac58cc18d7e7aa5584fb1af5d3f98a", "ja": "じゃじゃーん！　タコライス弁当っ！", "zh": "锵锵——！塔可饭便当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_1009", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6c8ff1d74926285541ae1b77c3cd94d70e1a260649f97b690f3be592c02a5d4c", "ja": "えっ！？　なんでこんな……タコライス弁当が？", "zh": "诶！？怎么会有这种……塔可饭便当？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_2001_013hib", "source_sha256": "0360b5ab2dc1e68ef8f646c0a41a5722572470575fdb00284de4868c5dca9e9e", "ja": "自分の手作りだぞ！　{$P$}、\n今日もご飯食べてないでしょ？", "zh": "这是我亲手做的！{$P$}，你今天也没吃饭吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_2002_p", "source_sha256": "12345820e1a381653179125a3f4f7e7c908a052fa52f69f155f37996b28bc3f7", "ja": "あ、ああ……気を遣わせちゃったな。ありがとう。", "zh": "啊、啊……让你费心了。谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_2003_013hib", "source_sha256": "9a324a97043361e04f0428d7d22e72d599741e0e6eb51d115fb5104c1b029907", "ja": "ふふーん♪　グルメバトルでは負けたけど、\n{$P$}の評価は、負けたくないしね。", "zh": "哼哼♪ 虽然在美食对决中输了，\n但我可不想输掉{$P$}的评价呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_2004_013hib", "source_sha256": "cc52c88285641c91c92142975dbe817faa1cd3c7498fd5a5aeee5fb3026a6c8f", "ja": "だから、ちゃんと感想言ってくれなきゃダメだぞ～。\nここで食べ終わるの待ってるからね！", "zh": "所以，你可得好好说说感想才行哦～。\n我会在这里等你吃完的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0273_2005_p", "source_sha256": "366b0faa60fadc522361673f6ff78794d452aaa902bf0c2ff29b16805a271b64", "ja": "（うっ、よだれが……響を待たせたら悪いし、\n仕事を切り上げて、すぐにいただくとしよう！）", "zh": "（呜，口水……让响等着也不好，还是赶紧结束工作，现在就开吃吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
